# Hold and drop

Read `Systems/Physics.md` before changing pickup, drop, hold, weight, or object collision.

The held object stays on a point in front of the camera. Simulation is off while it is held. Collision with the world stays on. A dropped key or weapon ignores players so a walk cannot push it through the floor. Doors and cabinets still block players.

Weight changes pickup time and walk speed only. Mass, collision shape, and Simulate Physics stay on the object's Blueprint.
